## Porting order

1. `globals.css` tokens + font
2. Shared layout chrome (header/footer/cta/cookie)
3. UI primitives (`Button`, `Container`, `SectionHeader`)
4. Home, then shared templates (solutions/pricing/company), then forms/login

## Parity checklist per page

- [ ] Matches Designs structure & spacing
- [ ] Responsive at key breakpoints
- [ ] One `h1`; sane `h2`/`h3`
- [ ] Unique `metadata` title + description
- [ ] Assets from `/assets/…`
- [ ] No duplicated header/footer markup
